PadForge
========

PadForge is an independent, native Linux text editor that recreates the
Notepad++ *workflow* (tabbed editing, session restore, find-in-files, macros,
column mode, etc.) using the Qt 6 and Scintilla/Lexilla toolkits.

Attribution
-----------
PadForge is *inspired by* Notepad++ (https://notepad-plus-plus.org/), a project
created by Don Ho and licensed under the GNU GPL v3. PadForge contains **no
Notepad++ source code, resources, or branding**. It was designed after studying
Notepad++'s publicly documented feature set and its use of the Scintilla/Lexilla
editing engine. We gratefully credit the Notepad++ project as the inspiration
for the workflow this editor reproduces.

